<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_fast__square__root_8hpp">glm/gtx/fast_square_root.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Fast but less accurate implementations of square root based functions.<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Sqrt optimisation based on Newton&apos;s method, www.gamedev.net/community/forums/topic.asp?topic id=139956</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</section>
